    "sentence_translations": [
      "My Favorite Sport",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: The weather is too hot today, and there are too many people playing basketball. I don’t want to play anymore.",
      "",
      "Anne: Here is some water. Drink some more water!",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: Thank you!",
      "",
      "Li: Gao Tian, do you like playing basketball?",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: … I don’t really like it.",
      "",
      "Anne: Huh? You don’t like playing basketball?",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: Li Xiaobei is your friend. I wanted to get to know him.",
      "",
      "Li: Now we know each other. We are friends now.",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: Great! I like exercising with friends.",
      "",
      "Li: What sports do you like?",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: I like to drive.",
      "",
      "Li: Is driving a sport?",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: Driving is a sport. My favorite sport is driving.",
      "",
      "Anne: I like running the most. Do you guys like running?",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: I like running! Can I go running with you?",
      "",
      "Anne: Okay! Xiaobei, do you like running? Can you go running with us?",
      "",
      "Li: Sure, I also like exercising with friends."
    ]
